<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Designer Deck Template v1</title>
    <style>
      @import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap");

      :root {
        --ink: #111111;
        --muted: #6f7785;
        --line: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
        --blue: #4A89C8;
        --gray-light: #E2E8F0;
        --gray-med: #94A3B8;
        --gray-dark: #64748B;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        width: 1920px;
        height: 1080px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #ffffff;
        font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .slide {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background: #ffffff;
      }

      .header {
        position: absolute;
        left: 92px;
        top: 62px;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 64px;
        line-height: 1.04;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .visit-bar-container {
        position: absolute;
        left: 182px;
        top: 240px;
        width: 1556px;
        height: 64px;
        display: flex;
      }

      .visit-bar-slot {
        width: 640px;
        height: 100%;
        border: 2px dashed #CBD5E1;
        background: #F8FAFC;
        border-radius: 8px 0 0 8px;
        position: relative;
      }

      .visit-bar-slot::after {
        content: "History";
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        top: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #94A3B8;
        opacity: 0.4;
      }

      .visit-bar-exam {
        width: 320px;
        height: 100%;
        background: var(--gray-light);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--gray-dark);
      }

      .visit-bar-decisions {
        width: 596px;
        height: 100%;
        background: var(--gray-med);
        border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      .connection-svg {
        position: absolute;
        left: 182px;
        top: 304px;
        width: 640px;
        height: 76px;
      }

      .lifted-history {
        position: absolute;
        left: 182px;
        top: 380px;
        width: 640px;
        height: 200px;
        background: var(--blue);
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 24px 48px rgba(74, 137, 200, 0.25);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: #ffffff;
        z-index: 10;
      }

      .history-title {
        font-size: 48px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      .history-sub {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 500;
        margin-top: 16px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      }

      .support-line {
        position: absolute;
        left: 182px;
        top: 612px;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--muted);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .proof-field {
        position: absolute;
        left: 940px;
        top: 380px;
        width: 798px;
      }

      .proof-row {
        position: relative;
        margin-bottom: 64px;
        padding-left: 32px;
      }

      .proof-bullet {
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        top: 10px;
        width: 12px;
        height: 12px;
        background: var(--blue);
        border-radius: 2px;
      }

      .proof-title {
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--ink);
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }

      .proof-text {
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-top: 8px;
        line-height: 1.4;
      }

      .bottom-statement {
        position: absolute;
        left: 182px;
        top: 840px;
        font-size: 40px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--ink);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        padding-left: 24px;
        border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      .footer-line {
        position: absolute;
        left: 112px;
        top: 992px;
        width: 1536px;
        height: 1px;
        background: var(--line);
      }

      .footer-logo {
        position: absolute;
        left: 1692px;
        top: 962px;
        width: 114px;
        height: 59px;
        object-fit: contain;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <section class="slide" aria-label="History is the cleanest place to reclaim minutes">
      <h1 class="header">History is the cleanest place to reclaim minutes.</h1>

      <div class="visit-bar-container">
        <div class="visit-bar-slot"></div>
        <div class="visit-bar-exam">Physical exam</div>
        <div class="visit-bar-decisions">Decisions + counseling</div>
      </div>

      <svg class="connection-svg" viewBox="0 0 640 76" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M2,0 L2,76 M638,0 L638,76" stroke="#CBD5E1" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"/>
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="640" height="76" fill="url(#conn-grad)" />
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="conn-grad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#4A89C8" stop-opacity="0.08" />
            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#4A89C8" stop-opacity="0" />
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
      </svg>

      <div class="lifted-history">
        <div class="history-title">History</div>
        <div class="history-sub">Relevant details • Timeline • Next questions</div>
      </div>

      <div class="support-line">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin-right: 12px; color: #94A3B8;"><path d="M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7"/></svg>
        A high-leverage target for pre-visit prep.
      </div>

      <div class="proof-field">
        <div class="proof-row">
          <div class="proof-bullet"></div>
          <div class="proof-title">Foundational to the encounter</div>
          <div class="proof-text">Shapes the starting point for what follows in the visit.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-row">
          <div class="proof-bullet"></div>
          <div class="proof-title">Time-variable</div>
          <div class="proof-text">Time required depends on complexity, communication, and context.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-row">
          <div class="proof-bullet"></div>
          <div class="proof-title">Can begin before the encounter</div>
          <div class="proof-text">A meaningful portion can start before the clinician is on the clock.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bottom-statement">
        But reclaiming those minutes still requires clinical judgment.
      </div>

      <div class="footer-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <img
        class="footer-logo"
        src="../../../../assets/logo/designer-health-logo-black.svg"
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </section>
  </body>
</html>
```
